{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-10-03 07:00:00', 'title': "KAREEM DANIEL ELECTED TO MCDONALD'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': "CHICAGO , OCT. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MCDONALD'S CORPORATION (NYSE: MCD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED KAREEM DANIEL AS AN INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR OF THE BOARD, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 1, 2022.\xa0 KAREEM DANIEL ELECTED TO MCDONALD'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS\xa0 MR."}